error[SC0407]: this may pass a pointer to an allocation that was freed
    ╭─[ an_escaped_pointer_handed_to_a_call_before_a_free_is_one_report.c:11:13 ]
    │
 11 │     return (memset(a, 0, 4) != 0) + (free(a), 0);
    │             ───────┬───────          ───┬───  
    │                    ╰────────────────────────── passed here, perhaps after the free
    │                                         │     
    │                                         ╰───── freed here
